{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About This Prologue</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This Prologue is a limited version of Liquor Shop Simulator that lets you experience the core gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What\u2019s included in this Prologue:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your shop by ordering products and stocking shelves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the in-game computer to place orders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Serve customers by scanning items and processing payments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A small shop area with basic product types.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What\u2019s not included in this Prologue:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shop expansion and customization options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full range of products.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progression and upgrades.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Add the full game to your wishlist to be notified when it\u2019s released and continue your shop adventure!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3717180?t=1746630092","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3717180?t=1746630092","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717180/88e6b1c969d75f811fbdd580060e7cd0304e2156/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746630092","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717180/88e6b1c969d75f811fbdd580060e7cd0304e2156/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746630092","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About This Prologue</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This Prologue is a limited version of Liquor Shop Simulat